      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-gold filled text-lg">star</span>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-gold filled text-lg">star</span>
    </div>
    <p class="text-white text-base leading-snug">"Lo mejor de nuestro viaje. Excelente musica, bebidas frias y servicio de primera."</p>
    <p class="text-white/50 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mt-2">Carlos G. &mdash; Mexico City</p>
  </div>
</div>
<button class="fleet-arrow left" onclick="heroNav(this,-1)"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">chevron_left</span></button>
